    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.poster.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.webm?t=1752423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.mp4?t=1752423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the speedy ride!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/2aa1bf470af18ca0f716e8a27fec4134.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to protect your car as an overzealous tow truck hurls you through the streets: Get dragged, tossed, launched through the air, and slammed into obstacles while trying to keep your car under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/5f1f4ecc94cfa632b56c6a2d63f403fa.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br>Once you're hooked, the tow truck mercilessly drags you along. You can briefly break free from the cable to steer on your own - but don\u2019t stay unhooked too long, or the tow truck will leave you behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/b3d017f541870c0e679207496e3f816b.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a variety of tracks, from bustling city streets to winding highways, and try to reach the garage without wrecking your car (even more). Hunt for shortcuts and hidden secrets - but don\u2019t unhook for too long, or you\u2019re not going anywhere!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.poster.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.webm?t=1752423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.mp4?t=1752423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the speedy ride!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/2aa1bf470af18ca0f716e8a27fec4134.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to protect your car as an overzealous tow truck hurls you through the streets: Get dragged, tossed, launched through the air, and slammed into obstacles while trying to keep your car under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/5f1f4ecc94cfa632b56c6a2d63f403fa.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br>Once you're hooked, the tow truck mercilessly drags you along. You can briefly break free from the cable to steer on your own - but don\u2019t stay unhooked too long, or the tow truck will leave you behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/b3d017f541870c0e679207496e3f816b.avif?t=1752423699\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a variety of tracks, from bustling city streets to winding highways, and try to reach the garage without wrecking your car (even more). Hunt for shortcuts and hidden secrets - but don\u2019t unhook for too long, or you\u2019re not going anywhere!</p>",
    "short_description": "Your beloved old car has broken down and needs to be towed! Hooked and hauled - time for the garage! But will you get there in one piece? The tow truck is in a hurry!",
